# The rise of $83:FCA5 held at its limit ($83:FCDE): each frame its speed
# ($1D) grows by $20 and is kept at most $45; with entry 0 of the table at
# $80:D9B2 ($45 = $800, $28 a frame) the actor is out of the ground long
# before. As cov_dungeon_switches.box's first play until the kind $31 at
# record $0C4B is in the rise (its $1D 0), then its $45 lowered to $30.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 0008E7 80,0B
poke 0008EA 80,00
poke 001773 00,0B
wait 82
poke 000C90 30,00
wait 60
